<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt extends &quot;winebox&quot; reporting date to May 31.</title>
<headline>NZ govt extends &quot;winebox&quot; reporting date to May 31.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government has granted a reporting date extension to the so-called &quot;Winebox&quot; Commission of Inquiry to May 31, a spokesman for the prime minister's office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said the government had received another request for a further extention, which was being considered.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
